{"id":"dd9febae42d44280","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-p.md","title":"Polynomial Time","display":"df-p — Polynomial Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","aliases":["28-df-p"],"display":"df-p — Polynomial Time","depends_on":["[[28-df-dtime]]"],"label":"28-df-p","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p — Polynomial Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-p"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a> 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+2)^a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+2)^a\">\\((n+2)^a\\)</span> 统一处理空串与短输入；在容许常数因子的复杂度约定下与通常的多项式并类一致。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义1.13；印刷25页；PDF51页。对应并类陈述已核对。</p>\n","